Remaining risk/test gap: the added tests cover the `BoostState` union behavior at [anima_hypr_daemon.rs:467](/home/vi/animaschedext/scheds/rust/scx_lavd/examples/anima_hypr_daemon.rs:467) and [anima_hypr_daemon.rs:482](/home/vi/animaschedext/scheds/rust/scx_lavd/examples/anima_hypr_daemon.rs:482), but there is no mocked or integration test proving `update_audio()` actually reconciles `last_keys` into the pinned map. Also, if `pactl` fails to spawn after audio PIDs were previously recorded, the error path logs but does not clear stale audio PIDs until a later successful poll returns an empty set.
